  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### How to setup/remove recurring Timekeeping records\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 23 May, 2019 at 11:42 AM\n\n\t\tTo setup recurring Timekeeping records, navigate to Payroll >> Manage Payroll >> Time Keeping >> Add Time Record >> check the box 'Recurring' and save the record (refer attached)\n\nTo stop recurring Timekeeping records,  navigate to Payroll >> Manage Payroll >> Time Keeping >> Action Drop-down >> Edit >> Un-check the box 'Recurring' (refer attached)\n\nClick here to watch how to setup Recurring Timekeeping records\n\nClick here to watch how to stop Recurring Timekeeping records\n\n\t\tRecurring op... (82.7 KB) \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115223\">Payroll</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188558\">Payroll FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to setup/remove recurring Timekeeping records\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 23 May, 2019 at 11:42 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p>To setup recurring Timekeeping records, navigate to Payroll &gt;&gt; Manage Payroll &gt;&gt; Time Keeping &gt;&gt; Add Time Record &gt;&gt; check the box 'Recurring' and save the record (refer attached)</p><p><br></p>To stop recurring Timekeeping records,  navigate to Payroll &gt;&gt; Manage Payroll &gt;&gt; Time Keeping &gt;&gt; Action Drop-down &gt;&gt; Edit &gt;&gt; Un-check the box 'Recurring' (refer attached)<p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/ebb7b201b27b4c499e0aaaf0edf7744e\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch how to setup Recurring Timekeeping records</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/300e32317f61411b87e6e50ebf4b9314\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch how to stop Recurring Timekeeping records</a></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t<div class=\"cs-g-c attachments\" id=\"article-9000169281-attachments\"><div class=\"attachment\"><img src=\"/images/helpdesk/attachments/9078375080/thumb\" onerror=\"default_image_error(this)\" class=\"file-thumbnail image\" alt